WEBVTT

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:20.390
Cuticle Detective Inaba

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:32.440
We Are Looking For This Person!

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:37.110
Name: Inaba Haruka

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:42.120
Meeting Room

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:42.740
Inaba
Detective
Agency

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:44.120
I made fliers.

00:01:44.690 --> 00:01:46.270
I heard from Ogi-san.

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:50.210
He said you were secretly trying
to find your brother on your own.

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:53.000
Well, I wasn't trying to
hide it or anything...

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:55.590
You're distant!
You're being distant, Inaba-san!

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:55.970
I can smell the pungent
odor of wet sewage.

00:01:55.970 --> 00:01:57.710
Distant! Distant!

00:01:57.710 --> 00:01:58.310
You stink, Inaba-san!

00:01:58.310 --> 00:02:00.490
You lie! It's floral.

00:02:00.490 --> 00:02:03.640
Not to mention, your investigation
probably consists of:

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:06.790
"Have you seen my white-haired brother?"

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:08.320
"My white-haired younger brother..."

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:09.440
"White hair."

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:11.780
Is there something wrong
with that method?

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:13.650
You'll never find him that way!

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:16.600
We'll help out.

00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:19.200
But I've been working on this
after we close the agency,

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:20.700
so it'd be pretty late.

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:24.120
The agency closes at six!
There's plenty of time to help out!

00:02:26.850 --> 00:02:28.120
Okay, help me, then.

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:29.080
'Kay.

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:31.790
But you really did a good job with these.

00:02:32.090 --> 00:02:34.990
I went ahead and used a picture
that was on the computer,

00:02:34.990 --> 00:02:37.070
but is there a more recent picture?

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:40.960
Well, it's been two years,
so I'm sure he's bigger now.

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:44.510
He has white hair and red eyes,
so I'm sure we'll find him quickly.

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:47.220
It's almost like he's a white rabbit.

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:49.050
Why don't you just buy a white rabbit
and call him your younger brother?

00:02:49.050 --> 00:02:51.120
Brother! I'm white!

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:52.820
That's my last resort.

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:55.980
I have to be proud of you for even
thinking of that as a last resort.

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:56.620
Inaba
Detective
Agency

00:02:56.620 --> 00:02:59.730
Well, let's get to info gathering
and handing out fliers.

00:02:59.730 --> 00:03:00.540
Sure.

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:14.250
I've been wanting to meet you,

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:18.470
Don Valentino.

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:21.860
I've also been wondering what

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:24.620
my terrorist clients looked like, I have.

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:27.930
We only reveal ourselves
to those we trust.

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:32.960
So, as you promised, let us hear it.

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:36.270
What is your name,
and what is your motive?

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:39.740
Haruka. My name is Haruka.

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:42.320
And this is Soumei-san.

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:43.530
Moko.

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:47.850
You see...

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:49.700
We want to eliminate the police.

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:54.620
We want to eliminate the incompetent,
depraved, authoritarian organization.

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:58.100
And then, when Japan is in disarray
due to the lack of police,

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:00.710
we will arrive as a public security force.

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:03.550
Just like heroes.

00:04:04.190 --> 00:04:05.260
Well then,

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:08.200
that would make you our future enemy.

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:09.300
Of course not.

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:11.780
If there are rules, we can coexist.

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:15.020
Light and darkness are meant
to respect each other.

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:16.150
I mean,

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:18.230
no matter how great a hero may be,

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:20.450
they're completely wasted
if there isn't a villain.

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:25.010
The greater the villain, the more
the masses will long for a hero.

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:28.250
To have the masses believe,

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:29.910
we need a charismatic villain
to threaten their peace.

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:31.580
Moko!

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:34.250
The only one capable of that

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:36.070
is you, Don.

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:40.420
We will work together, with my group

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:42.660
on the outside and you behind the scenes,

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:44.040
to control public security.

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:49.760
We can't become the villains
who publicly confront the police.

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:52.920
Until the police are overthrown,

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:57.970
you can have control over my
group and use it as you'd like.

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:01.140
Also, don't refer to us as terrorists.

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:06.470
Call us NORA, Don Valentino.

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:12.910
We are not yet so close as to share
the same ambitions, we are not.

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:15.960
We shall promise work worthy
of the reward, we shall.

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:19.220
See you again, Don.

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:24.260
The Don has left the room.

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:25.860
Send a car to retrieve him.

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:28.220
There weren't any
suspicious movements.

00:05:32.690 --> 00:05:33.510
Bang!

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:37.810
What's the matter, Gabriella?

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:41.230
Guess he's not just talk
when it comes to wanting

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:42.780
to destroy the Japanese police.

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:46.770
It will be the Don's decision to see
if we will be assisting in that dream.

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:48.930
Our job has already begun.

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:49.700
Yeah.

00:05:55.260 --> 00:05:57.000
Thanks for your support.

00:05:57.510 --> 00:05:58.910
Please help us out!

00:05:58.910 --> 00:05:59.670
Thanks!

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:02.440
There are a lot of police
cars out tonight.

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:04.960
Hey, there's a stretcher coming
out of the police box.

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:06.920
Excuse us! Coming through!

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:08.260
Step, step, step

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:10.830
Wait, what? There's no proof
of the bad thing I did...

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:12.850
You just confessed a little, Inaba-san...

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:14.740
Hiroshi, it's me.

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:15.560
Ogi?

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:17.770
Shinjuku Station East Exit Police Box

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.240
What the hell are you wearing?
Are you cosplaying?

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:21.230
There's a lot going on.

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:22.970
Perfect timing.

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:25.230
Here. You wear this, too.

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:29.120
Just because you're into
some weird new role play,

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:30.060
don't drag me into it!

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:31.400
It's work, you idiot!

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:33.280
Don't try to attribute everything to role play!

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:34.720
The way you two are acting,

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:36.660
I have to ask what kind of
role playing is going on...

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:38.990
For about two hours now,

00:06:38.990 --> 00:06:41.380
there have been a growing
number of cases of

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:43.090
uniformed police officers
being attacked.

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:44.550
And it's happening all over Japan.

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:48.050
Evidently, they're all being attacked
whether on patrol or in police boxes.
Irritation...

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:50.550
The number of victims keeps growing.

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:53.180
Officers who believe they can hold
their own are acting as bait.

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:55.040
The suspects are stealing
the officers' guns.

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:55.760
We're going.

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:59.910
Hey, wait a sec!
This sounds, like, dangerous!

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:00.440
There's a possibility that
Valentino is behind this,

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:01.850
No!

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:03.110
but it's hard to believe he'd be

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:03.360
behind something that he can't profit from.

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:05.360
Hey, listen to me!

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:06.020
Area Frequently Patrolled by Police

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:09.070
Even though you're in uniform, would they

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:11.400
really come after someone as big as you?

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:12.500
Who knows?

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:14.660
What are you doing out with your
assistants at this hour, anyway?

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:16.910
Area Frequently
Patrolled by Police

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:19.000
We're looking for Haruka.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:19.970
I see.

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:20.660
Roach Motel
Big Size

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:22.470
Whoa! What the hell is this?!

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:23.310
Is it a trap?!

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:26.380
I guess something really
compelled him to patrol here...

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:31.110
We got them! We got them!

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:37.430
Now, let's see what fools fell for it...

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:43.720
I hope you're prepared.

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:46.080
Maybe we should make you the eighth kid.

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:47.090
Shut up!

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:48.850
Like you can talk! You have
the intellect of an insect!

00:07:48.850 --> 00:07:51.030
So it was you who's been
attacking police officers!

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:52.660
Nii-Ni?

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:57.530
It's been a while, Nii-Ni.

00:07:57.530 --> 00:07:58.490
Haruka!

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:01.080
By Haruka, you mean your younger brother?

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:02.170
Yeah.

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:03.900
What?!

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:05.380
That means...

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:07.840
You are a wolf, you are!

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:08.590
Red Eyes.
Huh?

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:09.340
Ears?

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:10.090
White Hair.

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:12.090
But I'm a bunny wabbit.

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:13.840
Oh, that's okay, then.

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:15.920
Since I'm a rabbit and
Soumei-san is a sheep,

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:17.490
the wolf is our natural enemy.

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:18.810
He'll eat us!

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:22.610
Oh, comrades!
How cruel can the wolf be?

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:24.610
Hey, Haruka!

00:08:24.610 --> 00:08:26.350
Stop being so friendly with that goat!

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:27.610
No way.

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:30.420
Mr. Goat is my friend.

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:35.780
Too bad.
The wolf is being left out, he is.

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:39.020
Aw, he's crying.

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:40.620
Serves him right, it does.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:42.380
Let's rub it in even more.

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:45.020
Look how lovey-dovey we are.

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:48.500
It's even working on him.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:48.860
BFFs

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:50.930
Haruka! He's a bad goat!
BFFs

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:52.340
If you get too friendly with him,
BFFs

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:54.570
Nii-Ni's going to get angry!

00:08:54.570 --> 00:08:55.840
Weak, Inaba-san.

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:59.260
I don't care if you cry,
laugh, or get mad.

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:03.390
All I care about is your mind being
filled with thoughts of me.

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:06.090
I asked you to play with me, didn't I?

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:08.170
Over, and over, and over again.

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:11.360
You always chose your work over me.

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:14.150
I don't know how many times
I thought of killing you.

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:17.610
The attacks on the police
officers were my idea.

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:20.830
I'll eliminate the work that was
more important to you than I was.

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:25.570
You idiot! I don't remember
raising you like that!

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:27.420
Inaba-san, you're talking
like an angry mom!

00:09:28.050 --> 00:09:29.340
Hiroshi, how did you get out?!

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:30.770
I took off my shoes.

00:09:30.770 --> 00:09:32.090
I never thought of that...

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:36.970
I gave up being a police dog
because I wanted time to look for you...

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:40.030
I got fed up with my job
a number of times.

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:43.040
I only had regrets about
being born a police dog.

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:47.060
But I was able to get through it
because I had you by my side.

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:49.980
Like I would have been able
to do that job by myself!

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:52.880
But you're going back to it,
even if I'm not here, right?

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:55.050
I'm going home with you.

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:56.530
Therefore...

00:09:57.220 --> 00:09:59.050
I'll be the one to arrest you!

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:01.780
You need to pick a side, Haruka!

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:03.950
You're finally going to play with me!

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:07.620
To think that I get to play a
life-or-death game of tag with Nii-Ni...

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:10.660
I'm glad I became a villain.

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:14.320
Come get me!

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:15.630
Wait!

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:16.030
Why am I seeing a beach?

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:17.930
Wait!
Why am I seeing a beach?

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:20.810
Gotcha!

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:23.970
Oxygen

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:25.670
Oh, you troublemaker.
Oxygen

00:10:25.670 --> 00:10:28.100
Isn't your spoiling him like that
the cause of all of this?!
Oxygen

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:30.360
Hiroshi! Grab him now!

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:31.520
Oh, right.

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:33.540
Soumei-san!

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:40.810
It's a wolf!

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:42.850
It's a wolf in sheep's clothing!

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:44.790
What? A wolf?!

00:10:48.110 --> 00:10:50.340
There's only a rabbit and a sheep.

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:51.380
Behind you!

00:10:51.820 --> 00:10:55.590
So, you still think you can
beat me in a fight, Nii-Ni?

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:58.720
You're not the only one who's
changed in two years.

00:10:58.980 --> 00:11:00.470
Watch this! Yuuta!

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:02.090
Fall

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:05.930
Yuuta-kun, I don't seem
to have any strength...

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:08.040
That's because if you
catch your brother,

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:09.890
you're going to go back
to being a police dog.

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:11.600
A lovers' quarrel between
a wolf and a tiger?!

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:15.930
They're breaking up!
This is our chance, it is!

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:17.110
I forgot!

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:18.840
Bad idea! We retreat for today, we do!

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:20.570
Aw, but we're at a good part.

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:21.780
Don't move!

00:11:23.110 --> 00:11:24.700
If you move, I'll shoot!

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:28.120
There's no way you could shoot, Nii-Ni.

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:30.270
Inaba-san, calm down!

00:11:30.270 --> 00:11:31.080
Hiroshi!

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:32.830
Do it, do it, do it...
Do it, do it, do it...

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:36.800
Do it, do it, do it...

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:39.720
Haruka!

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:47.570
Since the suspects were stealing
guns from the officers,

00:11:47.570 --> 00:11:49.870
the bait officers only had fake guns.

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:54.480
Give me back my life's
worth of courage!

00:11:58.740 --> 00:12:01.340
It's the first time I've exercised
in a while, so I got a fever.

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:03.260
Such a frail child, you are.

00:12:03.260 --> 00:12:05.570
Are we really going to
be able to use him?

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:13.520
Nourishment

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:15.080
You actually hooked an IV on me...
Nourishment

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:18.230
Your treatment is rather
overbearing, Don.

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:20.380
A villain's body is vital, it is.

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:23.420
Hey, White One, your ride is here.

00:12:23.420 --> 00:12:24.880
Oh, Death is here?

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:26.430
A bit grim, no?

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:28.750
Nice to meet you, Don Valentino!

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:31.480
Thank you for taking care
of our precious comrade!

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:33.440
I'll introduce you, Don.

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:36.370
They're my backdrop, my extras.

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:38.670
Could you at least consider
us as supporting roles?

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:39.830
Natsuki
Supporting
Role
NORA

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:41.210
I am Natsuki.
Natsuki
Supporting
Role
NORA

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:41.300
I am Natsuki.

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:41.360
Yataro
I am Natsuki.

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:41.980
Also
Supporting
Role
Yataro

00:12:41.980 --> 00:12:43.900
The lanky one is Yataro.

00:12:44.590 --> 00:12:46.680
We shall protect you along
with Haruka-san, Don.

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:49.580
They're like my arms and legs.

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:54.300
They take care of things I'm not into,
like fighting and errands.

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:57.330
You pretty much live
off of others' kindness.

00:12:57.660 --> 00:13:00.100
So, you are in charge?

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:00.800
Yes.

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:04.340
But I'm a bit stuck.

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:06.370
Lend me your wisdom, Don.

00:13:07.990 --> 00:13:08.470
Cat Lover
Enchantment Case
Countermeasures
Headquarters

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:12.350
Meeting Room
Cat Lover
Enchantment Case
Countermeasures
Headquarters

00:13:14.050 --> 00:13:16.750
How to change a cat
lover into a dog lover?

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:17.520
Yes.

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:21.170
I want to know exactly how much it's
possible to control the hearts of people.

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:24.530
Dogs and cats have many similarities,
so I thought that may be easy.

00:13:28.110 --> 00:13:29.060
Goat! Goat! Goat!

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:31.130
If we can put that knowledge to use,

00:13:31.130 --> 00:13:33.190
it won't be long before we can
make all of Japan love goats.

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:35.240
You'll be a national icon.

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:36.100
Now on Sale!
Prima Stella

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:38.060
Maybe I'll release a CD.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:38.520
Now on Sale!
Prima Stella

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:40.380
Sold Out

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:45.280
All right, it's a prototype,
but I have the perfect machine, I do.

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:46.590
Take it!

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:47.590
Thanks!

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:51.310
Now we have to find a cat
lover for the experiment...

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:54.510
What's wrong, Inaba-san?

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:56.890
Kei, you idiot! I hate you!

00:13:57.300 --> 00:13:58.410
What'd you do?

00:13:58.410 --> 00:14:01.180
Well, I was late because
the train stopped, but...

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:02.810
I did send a text.

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:04.150
It's that text!

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:06.780
What the hell was that
picture attachment?!

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:09.420
It's my idol, Luna.

00:14:09.420 --> 00:14:11.220
Luna is a Sphynx cat
that has no hair and

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:13.270
is kind to me since I have a cat allergy.

00:14:13.270 --> 00:14:15.540
Stop making that face like this is
your only chance to look good.

00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:18.790
But she's so cute!

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:19.950
It's scary as hell!

00:14:19.950 --> 00:14:22.500
If it shows up in my dreams, I don't care
what time it is, I'm calling you to complain!

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:25.480
You're allergic to cats,
but love cats?

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:28.510
I tend to totally overreact
when it comes to cats.

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:30.320
Cats are great!

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:32.820
They're soft, fickle, and silly.

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:34.600
You should come over
sometime to see my baby.

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:38.230
You're actually inviting me
to your cardboard house?

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:40.360
I'm not <i>that</i> poor...

00:14:41.840 --> 00:14:43.650
Oh, someone's here.

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:45.130
Coming!

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:47.410
Meow.

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:50.500
Inaba-san!

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:51.160
Yeah!

00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:53.820
I'm going to prepare some warm milk!

00:14:53.820 --> 00:14:54.870
Don't show them hospitality!

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:57.660
Cuddle

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:01.380
What the hell?!
They're kidnapping him!

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:02.300
Inaba-san!

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:03.710
Kei!

00:15:04.270 --> 00:15:06.940
The day has come for me
to go to the cat kingdom.

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:08.780
I'll be leaving early today, 'kay?

00:15:08.780 --> 00:15:12.220
Such a fantasy kingdom doesn't exist!

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:15.400
It's no use! He's really worthless
when cats are involved.

00:15:15.400 --> 00:15:17.430
I don't see why we can't just ignore this...

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:21.220
Huh?

00:15:21.890 --> 00:15:24.330
This isn't the cat kingdom.

00:15:25.640 --> 00:15:27.250
Since it's a deserted house...

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:29.320
Could it be...

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:29.470
The cat mansion?!

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:31.070
Swoon
The cat mansion?!

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:31.380
The cat mansion?!

00:15:31.380 --> 00:15:33.360
You really are stupid, aren't you?

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:35.240
Huh? Haruka-san?

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:37.340
Do you still not get it?

00:15:37.340 --> 00:15:39.370
You were kidnapped.

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:42.240
We're not returning you
until you turn into a

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:43.960
dog lover instead of a cat lover.

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:44.000
Wha?

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:44.720
Wha...
Wha?

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:45.040
Wha...

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:48.630
What are you talking about?!
You tricked me! I'm going home!

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:53.890
squeeze...

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:55.800
You're not going back while
you're still a cat lover.

00:15:56.690 --> 00:15:58.530
Is he really planning
on not letting me go?

00:15:58.990 --> 00:16:01.470
I guess I could just pretend
to be a dog lover...

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:02.690
It'd be futile.

00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:05.310
Lies don't work on me.

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:06.610
What?

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:09.030
You seem to be underestimating my ability.

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:12.230
Conscious thoughts are plainly audible to me.

00:16:12.230 --> 00:16:14.240
I can hear the sounds of the heart.

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:17.480
There are many emotions
within the heart.

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:21.530
With every move the heart makes, they
bump into each other and make sounds.

00:16:21.990 --> 00:16:25.040
My ears can hear as far as the
depths of one's subconsciousness.

00:16:26.270 --> 00:16:29.940
I can hear the part of your heart
that you're not even aware of.

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:32.420
So you can read hearts?

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:34.780
Indeed. The more conflicted the heart,

00:16:34.780 --> 00:16:37.220
the more beautiful the sound it creates.

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:39.390
Right now, Nii-Ni's is wonderful.

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:43.100
Lies create noise within the heart,
so they're easy to detect.

00:16:43.590 --> 00:16:45.560
It's impossible to trick me.

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:50.030
All right. I'll tell you truthfully.

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:52.800
You have a terrible personality!
You suck!

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:54.690
I wasted my time adding "san"
to your name, you weakling!

00:16:54.690 --> 00:16:57.110
Oh, such a great voice with no noise!

00:16:57.110 --> 00:16:58.300
Keep talking.

00:16:58.300 --> 00:16:59.910
Are you brothers both masochists?!

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:01.180
Haruka-san!

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:03.440
The brainwashing machine is ready!

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:04.900
Brainwashing machine?!

00:17:06.180 --> 00:17:08.530
Oh! Let me go, Mr. Cat.

00:17:08.530 --> 00:17:09.750
You're the one clinging.

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:13.260
The danger is ridiculously obvious!

00:17:15.530 --> 00:17:17.800
And they just keep going! Stop!

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:19.960
We're just going to hijack the
brain's electrical signals

00:17:19.960 --> 00:17:21.440
and rewrite your memory.

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:22.290
It'll be okay.

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:24.230
How is any of this okay?!

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:24.690
Brainwashing-kun

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:27.760
We're going to rewrite all of
your feelings towards cats,

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:29.320
and make them towards dogs.

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:32.910
We're just going to take the love
you've shown toward cats thus far

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:34.560
and make it a love for dogs instead.

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:36.600
If you're a success,

00:17:36.600 --> 00:17:39.740
we're going to proceed and make other
cat lovers into dog lovers, too.

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:42.790
What do you plan to do after
making all those dog lovers?

00:17:43.630 --> 00:17:45.630
We're going to create
a new police force

00:17:45.630 --> 00:17:47.790
with Secret Dobermans
as the central pillar.

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:51.880
I want to increase our supporters.

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:54.790
I got that feeling,
but aren't you a rabbit?

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:56.340
You really are stupid.

00:17:56.690 --> 00:18:00.050
Did you really think Nii-Ni was
the first werewolf in Japan?

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:03.550
The history of the Secret
Dobermans is an old one.

00:18:03.550 --> 00:18:06.050
They had already turned their
backs on the Japanese police

00:18:06.050 --> 00:18:08.230
and had been making preparations
of their own in the shadows.

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:10.420
Because I knew the truth, I want to alleviate

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:12.020
my dilemma of keeping it secret for so long.

00:18:12.530 --> 00:18:15.450
The goal of NORA is
to realize an ideal state

00:18:15.450 --> 00:18:17.990
without misrepresentation and doubts.

00:18:18.380 --> 00:18:19.980
Those two there are wolves, too.

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:21.870
What? They aren't cats?

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:24.040
But you're on the goat's side, aren't you?

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:26.810
Do you really think the goat will
let you get away with that?

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:28.340
I can just dump the goat once
I'm done using him, can't I?

00:18:28.340 --> 00:18:30.600
Hi. We like using people.

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:33.000
He and Yuuta-kun are kindred spirits...

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:35.460
Now, let's have you be reborn.

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:39.820
S-Stop!

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:42.150
So, this is the place...

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:45.270
According to eyewitnesses,
they went inside...

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:46.430
Maybe he's dead already.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:50.150
Kei!

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:52.350
Aw, there, there.

00:18:52.350 --> 00:18:54.150
You're such a good boy, Yataro-chan.

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:55.500
Would you like some beef jerky?

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:55.630
There you go.

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:56.360
Beef Jerky

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:58.780
munch, munch, munch

00:18:59.290 --> 00:19:00.690
We may be disturbing something.

00:19:00.690 --> 00:19:02.620
Let's go home right now.

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:03.550
Inaba-san!

00:19:04.550 --> 00:19:08.210
Oh, there, there. Were you wonewy?

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:08.550
I'll play with you lots!

00:19:08.550 --> 00:19:11.170
What the hell is wrong with
you, Kei?! I'm not a cat!

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:12.180
Nii-Ni...

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:13.230
Haruka!

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:15.500
Whoa, you're totally skin and bones!

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:17.040
Don't make me worry
so much, you idiot!

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:18.420
I'm sorry...

00:19:18.740 --> 00:19:20.660
I wanted to create more
werewolf supporters,

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:22.500
so I thought about
increasing dog lovers...

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:24.000
But when I made the cat
lover a dog lover,

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.340
he hit a whole new level of annoying...

00:19:25.340 --> 00:19:27.320
He's just as bad as Ogata now!

00:19:27.320 --> 00:19:28.680
Give me back my harmless Kei!

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:31.580
So many friends have gathered here.

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:33.690
Let's all play nicely together, 'kay?

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:35.860
How do we turn him back?

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:36.810
I'm not sure.

00:19:36.810 --> 00:19:39.030
I'll try running the
electrical signal again!

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:41.070
If you need electricity,
leave it to me!

00:19:44.750 --> 00:19:46.690
Cuticle Bolt!

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:51.830
My ultimate attack has
been conquered by Kei!

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:56.130
It's impressive that even your
electricity looks like a dog, Nii-Ni.

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:59.010
Let me transform, too.
Let's both stop him.

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:00.550
Damn it. Go, Yuuta.

00:20:07.590 --> 00:20:09.100
Don't lose all of your
energy transforming!

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:11.580
I used up all of my calories.

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:12.940
How does it look, Haruka?

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:14.100
Woof, woof!

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:16.820
His love for cats is still
in his subconsciousness.

00:20:17.350 --> 00:20:20.780
It might be harsh, but we
can stop him from moving.

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:22.080
Haruka...

00:20:22.410 --> 00:20:25.210
You've actually made some friends...

00:20:25.210 --> 00:20:26.870
They're my arms and legs.

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:29.110
They're just puppets.

00:20:29.110 --> 00:20:31.110
Before transforming, I can
only receive thoughts.

00:20:31.110 --> 00:20:33.740
However, now I can
broadcast thoughts, as well.

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:37.250
They both move as I want them
to with my thoughts.

00:20:41.350 --> 00:20:43.050
Hey! That's too much! Stop!

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:44.300
Cut him, Natsuki!

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:48.760
Nail Cutter (For Dogs)

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:50.720
Your nails are too wong!

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.350
Beef Jerky

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:55.410
So much beef jerky, yay!

00:20:55.410 --> 00:20:57.310
Crap. He's too strong...

00:20:57.550 --> 00:20:59.360
My arms and legs are gone...

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:02.460
I'm still here! Read Kei's
thoughts and tell them to me.

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:03.070
Okay.

00:21:05.670 --> 00:21:07.390
He's coming, Nii-Ni...

00:21:07.390 --> 00:21:08.520
...with a carrier.

00:21:08.520 --> 00:21:10.490
Don't say things backwards
at a time like this!

00:21:12.350 --> 00:21:13.010
Curse you, my cute younger brother.

00:21:13.010 --> 00:21:14.330
Nii-Ni.

00:21:14.760 --> 00:21:15.870
Kei, snap out of it!

00:21:16.410 --> 00:21:18.150
You like cats!

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:19.880
Oh, what the hell was
that hairless cat called?

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:21.140
Luna.

00:21:21.140 --> 00:21:22.380
That's right! Luna!

00:21:24.660 --> 00:21:26.510
His subconsciousness is responding.

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:28.660
Nii-Ni, use a picture!

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:42.850
He was such a good person...

00:21:42.850 --> 00:21:43.110
Uh, he's alive!
He was such a good person...

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:44.410
Uh, he's alive!

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:45.900
Say something, Kei!

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:46.660
Yeah, whatever.

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:49.520
The enemy you brothers defeated
has come back to life.

00:21:49.520 --> 00:21:50.870
I said I was sorry!

00:21:52.530 --> 00:21:53.920
We're home, Don.

00:21:53.920 --> 00:21:55.640
What in the world were you doing?

00:23:26.270 --> 00:23:26.710
Let's kiss.

00:23:27.260 --> 00:23:28.090
I don't want to.

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:30.920
But you said you loved me!

00:23:30.920 --> 00:23:32.090
People are watching, though.

00:23:32.090 --> 00:23:34.270
What? Who cares?

00:23:34.270 --> 00:23:36.100
Kiss! Kiss!

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:38.680
Let us show off our love!

00:23:38.680 --> 00:23:41.270
You're laughing...
